<%# A single catalog card (DESIGN.md §3 Card, §4 catalog), rendered once per active
    registry calculator (issue #107 — the grid iterates the registry rather than
    hand-listing cards). `calculator` is a Calculator registry row; the card leads with a
    green category eyebrow (DESIGN.md §2), the calculator name, and its description blurb.

    Card link is GATED on the page actually existing (issue #214). A calculator is
    registry-active the moment its backend class lands, which can precede its frontend page
    (the backend-before-frontend merge window) — and a live link to a not-yet-built page
    500s (ActionView::MissingTemplate). So a page-backed calculator gets a live link; one
    whose page hasn't shipped renders as a non-linked "Coming soon" card (same shell, muted,
    not clickable, with a visible badge — never colour alone, DESIGN.md §6). This keeps the
    catalog truthful with no broken links during that window. %>
<% if calculator_page_ready?(calculator) %>
  <%= link_to "/calculators/#{calculator.slug}",
        class: "group rounded-[18px] border border-border bg-surface p-6 shadow-[0_10px_34px_rgba(150,110,80,0.12)] transition-colors hover:border-primary focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent" do %>
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent"><%= calculator.category %></p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink group-hover:text-primary"><%= calculator.name %></h2>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted"><%= calculator.description %></p>
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <%# Coming-soon card: not a link (no broken target), visibly muted, with an explicit
      "Coming soon" badge so the non-clickable state never rests on colour alone (§6). %>
  <div class="rounded-[18px] border border-dashed border-border-input bg-surface/60 p-6"
       aria-disabled="true">
    <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent"><%= calculator.category %></p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-faint"><%= calculator.name %></h2>
    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted"><%= calculator.description %></p>
    <p class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent">Coming soon</p>
  </div>
<% end %>
